## Map 委托

Kotlin 支持将属性委托给 Map，非常适合解析动态数据：

```kotlin
class Config(map: Map<String, Any?>) {
    val host: String by map
    val port: Int by map
    val debug: Boolean by map
}

val config = Config(
    mapOf(
        "host" to "localhost",
        "port" to 8080,
        "debug" to true
    )
)

println(config.host) // localhost
println(config.port) // 8080
```

可变版本使用 `MutableMap`：

```kotlin
class MutableConfig(map: MutableMap<String, Any?>) {
    var host: String by map
    var port: Int by map
}
```

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[属性委托选择] --> B{需求类型?}
    B -->|延迟初始化| C[by lazy]
    B -->|变化监听| D[by observable]
    B -->|赋值验证| E[by vetoable]
    B -->|动态数据映射| F[by map]
    B -->|自定义逻辑| G[自定义 ReadWriteProperty]
```

